<title>FINLAND: Finnish August jobless rate unchanged at 15.9 pct.</title>
<headline>Finnish August jobless rate unchanged at 15.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Finnish unemployment rate was unchanged versus July at 15.9 percent and it fell 0.3 percentage points from August last year, Statistics Finland (SF) said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>			 August 1996     July 1996	August 1995</p>
<p> Unemployed	    403,000	  421,000	  404,000</p>
<p> Jobless rate (pct)   15.9	     15.9		16.2</p>
<p>NOTE - The above figures are not seasonally adjusted.</p>
<p>Finland's labour ministry, calculating on a different basis, earlier said the August unemployment rate fell to 17.2 percent from 18.4 percent in July.</p>
</text>
